            "crew": "1 Pilot, 8 crew",
            "description": "<p>This colossal ship is built for one purpose: war. It wears that purpose proudly, with its massive spinal laser cannon, reinforced batteries, and anti-artillery armor clearly displayed to make a bold statement on whichever sea it finds itself. The battleship's passenger quarters are typically filled with off-duty crew rather than civilians, allowing it to be active around the clock as its crew and pilot operate in shifts. Despite its size, the apex battleship is far from sluggish or clumsy, with massive turbine engines that allow it to keep pace with smaller craft in battle.</p>",
